       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-CUSTOM-KERNEL-ABI.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-KERNEL-ABI-PROOFS.
           05  WS-OPKERNEL-REGISTER-EXACT  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHAPE-INFERENCE-PASS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VDSO-ZERO-COPY-DISPATCH  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TF-C-API-ABI-STABLE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SIMD-VECTOR-ZMM-ALIGNED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-KERNEL-ABI-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-KERNELS-PROVEN       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-KERNEL-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-OPKERNEL-AND-SHAPES.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-VDSO-AND-C-API.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-SIMD-ALIGNMENT.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-KERNEL-ABI.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-OPKERNEL-AND-SHAPES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OPKERNEL-REGISTER-EXACT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHAPE-INFERENCE-PASS.
       2000-EVALUATE-VDSO-AND-C-API.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VDSO-ZERO-COPY-DISPATCH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TF-C-API-ABI-STABLE.
       3000-EVALUATE-SIMD-ALIGNMENT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SIMD-VECTOR-ZMM-ALIGNED.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-KERNEL-ABI.
           IF WS-OPKERNEL-REGISTER-EXACT = 1 AND
              WS-SHAPE-INFERENCE-PASS = 1 AND
              WS-VDSO-ZERO-COPY-DISPATCH = 1 AND
              WS-TF-C-API-ABI-STABLE = 1 AND
              WS-SIMD-VECTOR-ZMM-ALIGNED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-KERNELS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-KERNEL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-KERNELS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-KERNEL-CODE.
